      equipment: '30-card pack and optional score sheet for match play.',
      dealing: 'Dealer gives 5 hand cards to each player. Non-dealer calls trump. Dealer then deals 5 face-down table cards in a row to each player and places 1 face-up card on each stack, giving each player 15 playable cards over time.',
